    "entry-00001": {
      "Id": "entry-00001",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Thank you. Czerka pays a bounty for what its forms call nuisance fauna, and you have earned it. Here is your pay. Ask me if you want more work around the base.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00000",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00002": {
      "Id": "entry-00002",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "You are back from the Tarnished Jungles, and the fence held all night for the first time since I landed. Did you kill all ten Jungle Bugs and all ten Shear Mites?",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00002",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00003",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00003": {
      "Id": "entry-00003",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Shear Mites chew the insulation off the perimeter cable, and then the Jungle Bugs come in through the dead section. I can't repair the fence while they are nesting in the treeline. I need you to go out to the Tarnished Jungles and kill ten Jungle Bugs and ten Shear Mites. Come back to me here when it is done and I will pay you.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00007",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00008",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00005",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00006",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00004": {
      "Id": "entry-00004",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Good. Kill ten Jungle Bugs and ten Shear Mites in the Tarnished Jungles, then come back to me here in the base. I will have the splice kit ready.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00004",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00005": {
      "Id": "entry-00005",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Security only guards the landing and the base door. The company files the fence under infrastructure, which makes it my problem, and nobody else is coming to help with it.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00008",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00005",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00006",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00006": {
      "Id": "entry-00006",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "They nest in the Tarnished Jungles, on either side of the track. You will hear the Shear Mites before you see them, because they sound like someone tearing cloth.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00007",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00005",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00006",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00007": {
      "Id": "entry-00007",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "I still need you to kill ten Jungle Bugs and ten Shear Mites out in the Tarnished Jungles. Come back to me when they are all dead, because the cable is still being chewed.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00010",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00008": {
      "Id": "entry-00008",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "This is cleaner ore than the company ships us. I will pour the housing tonight. Here is your pay, out of my own maintenance budget.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00000",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00009": {
      "Id": "entry-00009",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "You are back, and that looks like a full load of ore. Do you have the ten Raw Arkoxit and ten Raw Jasioclase I asked for?",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00012",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00013",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00010": {
      "Id": "entry-00010",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "The generator housing is cracked, and the replacement Czerka promised will arrive long after I have retired. I have a casting rig, so I can pour my own housing if I get the ore. I need you to mine ten Raw Arkoxit and ten Raw Jasioclase here on Dathomir and bring them back to me. I will pay you for the ore.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00017",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00015",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00016",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00011": {
      "Id": "entry-00011",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Good. Mine ten Raw Arkoxit and ten Raw Jasioclase on Dathomir, then bring them to me here in the base. Take a good harvester, because the rock here is stubborn.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00014",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00012": {
      "Id": "entry-00012",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "The mountains have the most veins. There are also veins out in the desert and down in the grottos, if you would rather fight different things on the way there.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00015",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00016",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00013": {
      "Id": "entry-00013",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "I still need ten Raw Arkoxit and ten Raw Jasioclase for the generator housing. The veins are in the mountains, the desert and the grottos. Bring the ore to me when you have all of it.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00019",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00020",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00014": {
      "Id": "entry-00014",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "The grain is straight and there are no soft spots, so this will do well. Here is your pay. If the wall is still standing next season, I will name a post after you.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00000",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00015": {
      "Id": "entry-00015",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "You are back, and I can see timber on your shoulder. Did you bring all ten lengths of Hyphae Wood for the palisade?",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00022",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00023",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00016": {
      "Id": "entry-00016",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "The palisade is rotting. I built it from the crates the base came in, and offworld timber only lasts about a season here. The hyphae trees on this planet do not rot. I need you to cut ten lengths of Hyphae Wood and bring them back to me, so I can replace the worst of the wall. I will pay you for it.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00027",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00025",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00026",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00017": {
      "Id": "entry-00017",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Good. Cut ten lengths of Hyphae Wood and bring them to me here in the base. The hyphae trees grow wherever it is wet, in the jungles and the grottos, and they glow a little.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00024",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00018": {
      "Id": "entry-00018",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "It is safer than a wall with a hole in it. Hyphae Wood is more fungus than tree, but once it cures it is as hard as plasteel.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00025",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00026",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00019": {
      "Id": "entry-00019",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "I still need ten lengths of Hyphae Wood for the palisade. Cut it from the hyphae trees in the jungles or the grottos, then bring it to me here.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00029",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00030",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00020": {
      "Id": "entry-00020",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "The cook has already started on it. Here is the payment from the stores, and he insisted that you take the first of the soup. It is good, because I checked twice.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00000",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00021": {
      "Id": "entry-00021",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "You are back, and I can smell something green for the first time in weeks. Did you bring the six Dathomir Oregano and six Turnips?",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00032",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00033",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00022": {
      "Id": "entry-00022",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "No. The mess is down to ration bars, and I run the stores as well as the fence, so the cook complains to me. He could make soup if he had fresh food. I need you to gather six Dathomir Oregano and six Turnips out in the wild and bring them back to me. The stores will pay you for them.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00037",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00035",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00036",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00023": {
      "Id": "entry-00023",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Good. Gather six Dathomir Oregano and six Turnips, then bring them to me here in the base. The herb patches and wild plots are scattered across the jungles and the grottos.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00034",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00024": {
      "Id": "entry-00024",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "A few things do. The herb patches and the vegetable plots out in the wild are safe to eat from. The cook tested them on a volunteer, and the volunteer was me.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00035",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00036",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00025": {
      "Id": "entry-00025",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
